      "message": "Cheng: My analysis shows that `fp_block_size` ultimately comes from `get_fp_block_size()`:\n\n```\nstatic inline BLOCK_SIZE get_fp_block_size(int is_screen_content_type) {\n  return (is_screen_content_type ? BLOCK_8X8 : BLOCK_16X16);\n}\n```\n\nSo its width and height are the same. But it is still better to use width and height correctly in this function to avoid confusion.",
